# Apply patterns to full URLs; exclude only addresses automated checks cannot assess reliably.
# 规则按完整 URL 匹配；仅排除自动检查无法可靠判断有效性的地址。

# shields.io may rate-limit badge requests; verify rendering manually.
# shields.io 可能限制徽章请求频率，显示是否正常需人工确认。
^https://img\.shields\.io/

# Workflow badges may fail before a branch has any runs, even with a valid URL.
# 分支尚无运行记录时，即使 URL 有效，工作流徽章也可能报错。
^https://github\.com/[^/]+/[^/]+/actions/workflows/[^/]+/badge\.svg

# Workflow pages may return 404 before the first run on the default branch.
# 工作流首次在默认分支运行前，相关页面可能返回 404。
^https://github\.com/[^/]+/[^/]+/actions/workflows/[^/]+/?$

# Repository search depends on sign-in state and may rate-limit anonymous requests.
# 仓库搜索受登录状态影响，也可能对未登录请求限流。
^https://github\.com/orgs/[^/]+/repositories\?
